{"p":{"slug":"joshua-allcorn","first":"Joshua","last":"Allcorn","cc":"SEY","iso":"sc","country":"Seychelles","g":0,"img":"https://platform.worldofsailors.com/storage/uploads/2026/08/17-joshua-allcor-3-1786264122.webp","cm":177,"kg":67,"bio":"Im Joshua Allcorn, a Seychellois sailor and multi sport national athlete. I’ve picked up many sports throughout my life, and I picked up sailing at 13, moving my way from Optimist to ILCA to skipper on a FarEast 28, winning national and regional championships. My life has revolved around the water and the tropics, exploring Seychelles’ reefs, islands and forests, while travelling to other countries through any sport I can compete my way into. When there’s wind, I sail/ kitesurf. Waves, I boggieboard. Clear water, I dive. Rain, I hike to find waterfalls, and of course, photograph as much of it as I can. BJJ, swimming, and sailing have taken me to many continental championships, securing multiple podiums, while creating the opportunity to explore the countru we are competing in. My goal is simple, I'm to help more people discover these sports and make our presence in international competitions much more pronounced.","soc":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/allcornadrift/"},"rk":{"s":[26337,17.52,26181,"2026-11-24",[24611,"2026-08-18"]]},"st":{"ev":6,"win":1,"pod":1,"avg":2.9,"best":1},"cls":["ILCA 6 (Open)","ILCA 4","Optimist"],"recn":0},"res":{"s":[["2026-07-18","2026 ILCA 6 Youth European Championships & Open European Trophy","Thessaloniki","GRE","ILCA 6 (Open)","Continental",178,314,3.7,12],["2026-07-08","Europa Cup Greece","Thessaloniki","GRE","ILCA 6 (Open)","International",87,202,12.7,7],["2025-08-07","CJSOI (Junior Indian Ocean)","Victoria","SEY","ILCA 4","Local",1,10,1.1,9],["2023-06-25","2023 Optimist World Championship","Costa Brava","ESP","Optimist","World",227,248,0,9],["2023-05-09","2023 Optimist African Championship","Mdiq","MAR","Optimist","Continental",63,88,0,8],["2022-10-01","2022 Optimist African Championsh